# One Y motor (Y1), the other side an idler rail with its own friction and
# a passive scale (drive y2 none): a Y move twists the bridge, more with the
# carriage far from the driven side; the passive scale shows it.
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/portal.portal
drive y2 none
guidey2 15 10
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.2
move 0.5 900 300
run 0.3
mark
move 0.6 900 700
print max_rack y1 y2 max_cur_y1 cur_y2 fault
@expect portal.max_rack > 100
@expect portal.y2 ~ 700 0.2
@expect portal.cur_y2 == 0
@expect portal.fault == 0
@reject ^ERROR
